			<div class="content" id="post-content-4680765">
									

<p>No Vote. I don't dislike Kara as a character but I feel like there is no reason for them being apart of the story. This isn't a bad idea overall but I don't think this idea is explored to its full potential. I wanna see more stories about Kara but I don't feel that this SCP is the place for it. Because it comes across like your trying to tell two stories at once. One about a little girl who creates stars and the other about an SCPs relation to a researcher. If you wanna tell a story about your author's character and have them relate to an SCP than do it I have no problem with it. However, the problem I see with this is that there is no reason to include kara.</p>
<p>I feel like kara needs a bit more of a personality. Just being nice is not enough for me. What makes kara, kara. What are there wants and needs? What are there strengths and what are there weaknesses. What makes them who they are. The nicest person in the universe still has flaws we are imperfect by nature and that is what makes us human.</p>
<p>Sorry if this comes across as harsh. That was not my intent I think you as an author have tones of potential. You have amazing art and you are an amazing writer.</p>

